  "description": "Change of use: Garages / storage to Pilates Studio (Class E) on ground floor; single storey front extension; external alterations",
  "epc_number": null,
  "ward": "Pinner",
  "last_updated": "2026-11-18T11:17:03.342Z",
  "street_name": "BRIDGE STREET",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The development hereby permitted shall be carried out in accordance with the following approved plans and documents:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;2026/048 -01A, 2026/048 -02A, 2026/048 -03A, 2026/048 -04A, 2026/048 -06A, 2026/048 -07A, 2026/048 -08A, DESIGN AND ACCESS STATEMENT (Faluck Patel), CIL Form 1, FIRE STRATEGY STATEMENT, Form 4 – Reasonable Exception Statement, Warrior 2 – Horizontal locker Bike Storage, including as agreed on 27/10/2026 – 97733-02 Rev v1.1, Flood Risk Assessment and Surface and Foul Water Drainage Strategy for Planning (October 2026), WinCan Import in Miraculix WRc4 Standard v3 (07/10/2026), Permeable Asphalt Detail.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "The development hereby permitted shall be begun before the expiration of three years from the date of this permission.",
    "The materials to be used in the construction of the external surfaces of the development hereby permitted shall match those stated in supporting documents.&amp;nbsp;",
    "&lt;p&gt;The use hereby permitted shall not be open to customers outside the following times:-\r\n&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;(a) 07:00 hours to 22:00 hours, Monday to Saturday inclusive,\r\n&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;(b) 07:30 hours to 22:00 hours on Sundays and Bank Holidays,\r\nwithout the prior written permission of the local planning authority.&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Cycle Storage&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Notwithstanding the approved plans, prior to the first occupation of the development, details of secure and sheltered cycle storage, including its precise location on the curtilage of the site, together with dimensions, elevations, capacity and external materials, shall be submitted to and approved in writing by the Local Planning Authority. The approved cycle storage shall be installed and made available for use prior to the first occupation of the development and shall be retained and maintained for that purpose thereafter.&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;Notwithstanding the approved plans, prior to the first use of the development, details of the refuse storage area, including its precise location within the site curtilage, dimensions, capacity and enclosure details, shall be submitted to and approved in writing by the Local Planning Authority. The approved refuse storage area shall be provided prior to the first use of the development and shall thereafter be retained for refuse and recycling storage purposes. Refuse and recycling containers shall be stored within the approved storage area at all times other than on collection days.&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Operational Management Plan&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Prior to the first occupation of the Pilates Studio hereby approved, an Operational Management Plan shall be submitted to and approved in writing by the Local Planning Authority. The Plan shall include:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;a) The proposed hours of operation of the Pilates Studio;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;b) Details of the anticipated number of attendees, including an hourly breakdown of expected visitor numbers during peak and off-peak periods;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;c) Information on the anticipated modes of transport to and from the site;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;d) An assessment of the likely parking demand associated with the use and its impact on surrounding parking provision; and&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;e) Details of measures to encourage sustainable travel, including the use of the approved cycle parking facilities.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The development shall thereafter operate in accordance with the approved Operational Management Plan unless otherwise agreed in writing by the Local Planning Authority.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Secure by design&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Evidence of certification of Secure by Design Accreditation for the development shall be submitted to the Local Planning Authority in writing for approval before any part of the development is occupied or used. The development shall only be completed and operated in accordance with any approval.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
